WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.600
Hey there Wisconsinites.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.860
Or Wisconsonians.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.093
Wisconsin.

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:11.080
People who live in Wisconsin.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:12.810
There, nailed it.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.410
Conan O'Brien here, reminding
you that registering to vote

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.970
is as easy as hitting
Davante Adams in the flat

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:19.410
if you're Aaron Rodgers.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.100
Or hitting the broad side of a barn,

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.750
if you're Jordan Love.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.680
You Packers fans know exactly
what I'm talking about.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.350
If you don't register to vote,

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.440
that would be like trading
up in the first round

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.410
of the NFL draft to take a
QB who is still years away

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:33.940
from being a viable starter,

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.680
even though you have
a future Hall of Famer

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.190
at the same position, who's still playing

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:38.963
at the top of his game, right?

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.730
Anyhow, democracy is a lot like poutine.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.720
No matter how crispy the French fries are,

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.020
and no matter how savory the gravy,

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:53.030
democracy is only as delicious
as the cheese curds on top.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.970
And in this metaphor,
the cheese curds are you,

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.730
the great voters of Wisconsin.

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:01.570
You are the cheese curds.

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:04.260
And if you want your
democracy to be delicious,

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.650
you will climb up on top

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:08.680
of those gravy smothered French fries.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.780
Now you see in that scenario,

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.780
that's you voting in this metaphor.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:14.140
You see, I hope that clears everything up.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.560
You, the poutine, you get it.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.900
Anyway, make sure to vote.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:21.567
Remember Wisconsin, October 14th

00:01:27.633 --> 00:01:29.420
Be the cheese curds.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:33.003
I know you are, that you can be.

